"] "\n\n" [:p {} "In the first semi-final the surprising Greeks continued their unexpected run, defeating Australia 6-2 to move on to the finals. Italy trailed the United States for much of the other semi, but eventually won 6-5. Italy had defeated Greece, 7-2, the group play, but the final was much closer. The match was tied 7-7 at the end of regulation. Greece went ahead 9-7 in the first overtime, but Italy came back to tie the match again, and then won the gold medal in the second overtime, 10-9, on a goal by " [:a {:href "/athletes/109380"} "Melania Grego"] "."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button25534", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button25534').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Games Played", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "GP"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Goals/Saves"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Shot %"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Natural Action Goals/Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Centre Goals/Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Extraman Goals/Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "7-metres Goals/Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Penalty Shot Goals/Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Counter-Attack Goals/Attempts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Assists"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Turnover Fouls"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Steals"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Blocks"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Exclusion (20 seconds) (Centre/Field)"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Penalty Fouls"] [:th {:style "display: none",